WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.408
A shopper wants to choose how the brands are ordered. Here we open the Brands page and look at its new Sort control and the default order.

2
00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:15.280
Under the Brands heading and above the cards, a Sort control offers two options: Name and Most products.

3
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.280
Name is selected from the start, and Most products is not.

4
00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:23.699
So the cards follow alphabetical order, beginning with AirStrider.

5
00:00:23.699 --> 00:00:28.075
Legend sits in the middle of the list, right where the alphabet puts it.

6
00:00:28.075 --> 00:00:32.075
And Zephyr closes the list as the last brand.

7
00:00:32.075 --> 00:00:38.179
Shoppers land on a familiar A to Z list, with a clear choice to reorder it by product count.
